/ Poll response. While the command is still pending this renders no streams, so
/ the poller leaves the spinner up; once settled it hands off to the shared
/ settled partial (result swap, toast, and a modal refresh on success).
- if command.settled?
  = render "servers/territories/pay_settled", command:, target: server_command_id(command), current_server:, refreshed_territory:, refreshed_player:, retry_territory:
